{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/4/desc","kr_sha":"43da8f2faf5af065a534f87945d13e2671f10c1f1b86cbf5539f9d5668181a0f","zh":"對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/4/dlg","kr_sha":"ace1ddbbf8c5d2802ea4df231d7685a22ebe52940c1c357924b5bd0d12fc61f2","zh":"嗯……是啊，果然是這樣吧？究竟是因為我們的分部就在附近，還是因為這裡本來就經常會發生這種事，才會把我們的分部設在這裡呢……附近的客棧，老是有人動不動就打起來呢。\n當然～對我們來說，能因此增加委託，倒是值得慶幸的事就是了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/4/id","kr_sha":"04a8bd6a57690db6ff5815712b06835c78aabb05925f1e37369968bed6a1fb93","zh":"smalltalk_10616_1","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/5/desc","kr_sha":"ae22d4fc09a33be838e1721a7aa26d5dbd2dd2aab86575413ab771d478069747","zh":"對話 2","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/5/dlg","kr_sha":"5555b23e12f05ea27e899ce8c414436bba3626fafc7ea12414844afaec7ce0bf","zh":"怎麼一看到我，就急著避開視線呢……啊，原來是前幾天跟我決鬥的那位啊！您的傷已經沒事了嗎？\n不用這麼躲著我也沒關係的。那不過是工作而已，並沒有摻雜什麼私人感情。讓我請您吃個小籠包，暖暖身體吧？畢竟託您的福，那天可是賺了不少呢！","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/5/id","kr_sha":"ba30e22463c7a5b147300bb77037b0762ef1bbe01ca29b8025f2d604c4b597b5","zh":"smalltalk_10616_2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/6/desc","kr_sha":"65e016ef58165be68acb39554fb899828842c8c1029509638e067da9d0efde1f","zh":"對話 3","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_EastCinq_10616.json|/dataList/6/dlg","kr_sha":"a8fb4f85651f108359382d8e3b7afd45c3f2b29e30481a372792dcc23fa20f47","zh":"不覺得決鬥是件很美好的事嗎？如果只是毫無規則地戰鬥，武術不過是用來傷害他人的手段……但決鬥能讓雙方以禮相待、互相問候，待一切結束後握手言和，不留恩怨地回歸日常，這點非常好呢。\n哎呀～畢竟三階段決鬥也不是那麼常發生的事嘛？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
